<p class="standfirst">My real boss.</p>

<p>This is Luna. She is 9 years old and supervises every session from the top of my keyboard.</p>

<p>Occasional foley contributor: purrs, chirps and the odd annoyed meow have all ended up in a project.</p>

<h2>Likes</h2>
<ul>
  <li>Cheek scritches</li>
  <li>Temptations</li>
  <li>Sitting on whatever I’m working on</li>
</ul>

<h2>Dislikes</h2>
<ul>
